# CiteGuard — Environment Configuration
# Copy this file to .env and customize as needed.

# Email for Crossref/OpenAlex polite pool (recommended for better API limits)
CITEGUARD_MAILTO=citeguard@giize.com

# OpenAlex API key (free: https://openalex.org/). Without it, all requests from
# one IP share a small daily budget (~100 title searches) and then fail with 429.
# Note: the app does not load .env itself; export it in the process environment
# (e.g. the `env` block of ecosystem.config.js on the server).
# OPENALEX_API_KEY=
